      "claim": "Fairtrade International’s certification scheme does not include finished electronic devices such as laptops.",
      "evidence": "Fairtrade International’s list of eligible product categories (e.g., coffee, cocoa, bananas, gold) contains no entry for computers or consumer electronics, and the certification standards explicitly limit scope to those categories.",
